# Datalane

- Pipeline: Ingest → Transform → Deliver (`core/pipeline.py`).
- Triggers: CLI / cron in `core/triggers.py`; entry `scripts/run_job.py`.
- New business: `jobs/<id>.yaml` + plugin under `plugins/` only.
- Do not add business logic under `legacy/` or new root `main_*.py`.
